## This is a tracking ticket

The executable work is in these children. The tracker is not itself a blocker.

| child | scope | blocked by |
|---|---|---|
| `0489` | Extract the incumbent MiniLM chain as one entry | -- |
| `0490` | Make all vector-affecting fields authoritative; prove parity | 0489 |
| `0492` | Add curated entries and select by entry id | 0490 |
| `0493` | Validate the chosen entry on the actual local runtime | 0492 |
| `0494` | Optionally aggregate content-free compatibility attestations | 0493 |
| `0495` | Decide which entries ship and whether the default changes | 0493 |

Companion ticket 0491 is a parallel policy experiment, fed by Zotero-runtime
probe 0496; neither is an implementation child or blocker for 0492–0495. Close
this tracker after the children in the table close and the integration review
confirms that no stage silently changed the incumbent behavior; 0491 and 0496
may remain open independently.
